1
00:00:00,148 --> 00:00:01,548
(Bernadette:)Whatcha doing?
Oh!

2
00:00:01,549 --> 00:00:04,179
(Howard:)Making myself a bologna sandwich
like my mom used to make me

3
00:00:04,185 --> 00:00:06,785
(Howard:)after my dad left,
but before she died.

4
00:00:11,325 --> 00:00:12,425
(Bernadette:)Okay, listen, I'm thinking

5
00:00:12,426 --> 00:00:14,826
(Bernadette:)that maybe we can compromise
on the house.

6
00:00:14,829 --> 00:00:17,359
(Howard:)I'm listening.

7
00:00:17,365 --> 00:00:20,335
(Bernadette:)Let's just redo one room
and see how it goes.

8
00:00:20,334 --> 00:00:21,704
(Howard:)That is reasonable.

9
00:00:21,702 --> 00:00:23,602
(Howard:)But what room?

10
00:00:23,604 --> 00:00:25,204
(Bernadette:)How 'bout this one?

11
00:00:25,206 --> 00:00:29,906
(Howard:)No way. No, this is the room I
associate the most with my mom.

12
00:00:29,911 --> 00:00:31,841
(Bernadette:)Then how 'bout the bathroom?

13
00:00:31,846 --> 00:00:34,716
(Howard:)I want to change my answer.

14
00:00:34,715 --> 00:00:37,415
(Bernadette:)Fine. Then the dining room.

15
00:00:37,418 --> 00:00:40,048
(Howard:)I guess we didn't use it
very often.

16
00:00:40,054 --> 00:00:41,424
(Howard:)Unless we had company.

17
00:00:41,422 --> 00:00:43,952
(Howard:)Which didn't happen much
after my dad left and not at all

18
00:00:43,958 --> 00:00:44,668
(Howard:)after my mom...

19
00:00:44,694 --> 00:00:46,374
Great! I'm gonna go
pick out paint samples.

20
00:00:49,096 --> 00:00:51,226
(Adam:)All right, we're just gonna
have a conversation.

21
00:00:51,232 --> 00:00:53,562
(Adam:)Pretend the
camera's not here.

22
00:00:53,568 --> 00:00:55,698
(Bernadette:)All right.
But this better not be

23
00:00:55,703 --> 00:01:00,023
(Sheldon:)some elaborate scheme
to get me out of my shirt.

